  "summary": "<p>For years, the nation’s capital was allowed to decay — marred by crime, graffiti, and crumbling infrastructure — amid a bureaucratic acceptance of decline as inevitable. President Donald J. Trump rejected that surrender from Day One — and under his leadership, the Trump Administration is demonstrating that decline is a choice. This week, the historic [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/05/decline-is-a-choice-president-trump-restores-pride-and-beauty-to-americas-capital/\">Decline Is a Choice: President Trump Restores Pride and Beauty to America’s Capital</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
